    "collapsible_content_XpDPY4": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_Tzddr6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the best perfumes in Pakistan for men?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The best perfumes for <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">men in Pakistan </span>last long, project well, and suit warm weather. At Mushk, top picks include Salsa Spirit, Wild Essence, Zarak, Apex, and Royal Oud, all inspired by iconic designer fragrances and priced under Rs. 2000.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cb8nrG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the best perfume brands in Pakistan?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Mushk is one of the best perfume brands in Pakistan, offering designer-inspired fragrances at affordable prices. Known for high-quality, long-lasting scents, Elyscents has a variety of options, from fresh citrus to smoky oud, perfect for Pakistan’s weather.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_B49nEd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I find affordable perfumes in Pakistan that last?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Mushk is one of the best places to find affordable perfumes in Pakistan that genuinely last. Our fragrances are formulated at high concentration levels to give you real longevity at a fair price.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LG8HTj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the best branded perfumes for men in Pakistan?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Top branded perfumes for men in Pakistan at Mushk include <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Salsa Spirit</span>, inspired by Creed Aventus, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Wild Essence</span>, inspired by Sauvage Dior, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Zarak,</span>inspired by Azzaro Wanted, and <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Apex,</span>inspired by Dunhill Desire.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_bbTKry": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How should I apply perfume to make it last longer?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Apply to pulse points like your wrists, neck, and behind your ears. Do not rub your wrists together after applying. Apply right after a shower for best absorption.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yQVa9h": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the difference between EDP and EDT?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>EDP has more fragrance oil and lasts longer on the skin. EDT has less oil and fades faster. Most Mushk perfumes are EDP level.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_X3rHhp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do Mushk perfumes work well in Pakistan's hot weather?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Fresh and aquatic scents work great for hot days. Woody and oud scents perform better in cooler months or evenings.</p><p>Our full range covers both needs.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
